# Build context is the repository root (see Dockerfile). BuildKit reads relay/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# (identical to this file); a root-level .dockerignore would also be honoured. The Dockerfile's
# narrow COPY list is the real guarantee of image contents; this only keeps the context small.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
node_modules
out
*.vsix
*.log
tmp
temp
